The Council of Althane is the meeting of the world's rulers that [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]] called to [[Geography/Althane/Athrea/Thyropae/index|Thyropae]] after they destroyed [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/The Deep|the Deep]]. The summons reached every person of Althane at once, and the delegations that answered came from [[Geography/Althane/Illyara/index|Illyara]], [[Geography/Althane/Salores/index|Salores]], [[Geography/Althane/El-Rasar/index|El-Rasar]] and the [[Geography/Althane/Shimmering Isles|Shimmering Isles]]. [[People/Althane/Marzo|Marzo]] spoke for the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/index|Gulch]].

[[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]] sent no one, and the Weft dealt with its [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]] directly. [[Geography/Althane/Brejvasing/index|Brejvasing]] had no ruler left, so the Weft helped a new one take power in exchange for opening the country.

The council's work is the opening of borders and trade between countries that had kept to themselves, and a pooling of magic and learning against what lies outside the world. It is not a government and its members keep their own rule.
